---
import { ink } from "../../lib/ink";
---
<section class="line" aria-labelledby="line-h">
  <h2 id="line-h">The line so far</h2>
  <p class="soft">Where the string has been. Pencil is mine; the typing is the official version.</p>

  <article class="sheet">
    <span class="ink string" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("line-v")})`}></span>
    <header class="sheet-head">
      <p class="typed">Curriculum vitae &mdash; draft 7</p>
      <p class="pencil hand">still editing</p>
    </header>

    <div class="entry">
      <span class="ink knot" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("knot-1")}); --ar:580/200`}></span>
      <p class="when">May 2021 &rarr; now</p>
      <h3 class="typed">Volunteer Web Developer &middot; Polish School Bristol</h3>
      <p class="typed body">Look after the digital home of a <span class="m m-under">community school<span class="ink" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("pencil/underline")})`}></span></span>. It's where I learned that every interface has a person waiting on the other side.</p>
      <p class="margin hand">Before anyone paid me, someone trusted me.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
      <span class="ink knot" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("knot-1")}); --ar:580/200`}></span>
      <p class="when">Jun 2023 &rarr; Sep 2024</p>
      <h3 class="typed">Frontend Developer &middot; VenueNow &mdash; ParkBunny</h3>
      <p class="typed body"><del class="m m-strike"><span class="sr-only">Correction: strikethrough </span>Implemented features.<span class="ink" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("pencil/strike")})`}></span></del> Owned the frontend of the ParkBunny operator platform: architecture, UI patterns and <span class="m m-circle">role-based access<span class="ink" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("pencil/circle")})`}></span></span>. Dashboards, charts, filtering and tariff management.</p>
      <p class="typed tools">tools: React 18 &middot; TypeScript</p>
      <p class="margin hand">Where I learned to ask why before how.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
      <span class="ink knot" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("knot-1")}); --ar:580/200`}></span>
      <p class="when">Sep 2024 &rarr; Apr 2025</p>
      <h3 class="typed">Frontend Developer &middot; OLM Systems, now Civica ECLIPSE</h3>
      <p class="typed body">Frontend on a case management platform for social care, spread across several repos and microservices. <span class="m m-circle">Legacy refactoring<span class="ink" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("pencil/circle")})`}></span></span>, testing, and real-time data over WebSockets.</p>
      <p class="typed tools">tools: React 18 &middot; GraphQL &middot; Formik &middot; MUI &middot; Storybook</p>
      <p class="margin hand">Reading code is most of the job.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
      <span class="ink knot" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("knot-1")}); --ar:580/200`}></span>
      <p class="when">Apr 2025 &rarr; Jan 2026</p>
      <h3 class="typed">Frontend Developer &middot; Shaka</h3>
      <p class="typed body">Frontend architecture for a family of white-label eSIM platforms: a monorepo and a <span class="m m-under">shared design system<span class="ink" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("pencil/underline")})`}></span></span>. Stripe payments, auth and account flows.</p>
      <p class="typed tools">tools: Next.js 15 &middot; TypeScript &middot; Tailwind &middot; Stripe</p>
      <p class="margin hand">Half the job is deciding what not to share.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="entry">
      <span class="ink knot" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("knot-1")}); --ar:580/200`}></span>
      <p class="when">Jan 2026 &rarr; now</p>
      <h3 class="typed">Front End Developer &middot; Novira Technologies</h3>
      <p class="typed body">Frontend for a circular-packaging platform: an operations dashboard, kiosks and smart bins. Role-based views, interfaces for hardware, and <span class="m m-tick">testing.<span class="ink" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("pencil/tick")}); --ar:1/1`}></span></span></p>
      <p class="typed tools">tools: React 19 &middot; React Compiler &middot; TypeScript &middot; WebSockets &middot; Stripe</p>
      <p class="margin hand">First UI I've had to wipe clean.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="entry entry-next">
      <span class="ink knot" aria-hidden="true" style={`--src:url(${ink("knot-1")}); --ar:580/200`}></span>
      <p class="when">soon</p>
      <h3 class="hand">Front End Developer &middot; HID Global</h3>
      <p class="hand body">Starting soon at HID, the people behind the quiet technology that decides which doors open and who is really there. Identity, trust and security, at a scale most people never notice. I'm very excited to see what's past the edge of this page.<span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
      <p class="margin hand">next page &rarr;</p>
    </div>
    <p class="aside aside-nosupport hand">your browser sees the finished drawing, on purpose</p>
  </article>
</section>
